==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
With very little time to save at the beginning of the stage, you'll want to dump as much cash into a heavy hitter as early as possible. Getting more than one extra [[Worker Cat]] level will work against you.

The Zir Zeal spawns without the enemy base being hit and will burrow right to your base if you're not careful. Keeping [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killers]] in reserve to deal with him is the way, otherwise he will take a big chunk out of your base.

If you time your units just right, you can take out the Zir Zeal and the other units all at the same time. Still, try to force the Zir Zeal to burrow ASAP if possible.

Dealing with the Imperator Sael and the Le'boin is second fiddle to the Zir Zeal, so once you deal with him the rest shouldn't be much trouble.

